            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Gallimore, R., Ermeling, B.A., Saunders, W.M., & Goldenberg, C. (May, 2009, in press). Moving the Learning of Teaching Closer to Practice: Teacher Education Implications of School-based Inquiry Teams. Elementary School Journal (special issue)",
